  "reference": "Jobo 40",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "40",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 40"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "40",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwakula Yoba, nindi Muntu wayikonkojola atadiki naChinaweji? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamuzuŋishaŋa Nzambi akulumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba hakumwakula Yehova, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Ami muntu wamukunkulwayi nukukwakula namidi? Nakumini dehi dakukwata chikasa kukanwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahoshi dehi kamu, hinukwakula nawaku; nikayedi, hinukunuŋaku nawa cheŋi izu dikwawuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwakula Yoba muchinjimbi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Pimpilaku dinu mahineyi awuyala, muloŋa nakeŋi kukwihula wunleji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunakeŋi wujahi wuŋaji wami? Wunakeŋi wunfwishami, kulonda eyi wuyiŋi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wukweti chikasa chidi neyi chaNzambi? Wunatweshi kudidima nezu neyi chelaŋayi yena?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadileŋaleŋi nakulema nákubula kudisawula, vwalaku niwutotombu niwukeleŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sumpokaku kuzuwa kweyi, wutali antu ejima adinka wanta, wuyizozeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talaku antu ejima adivwimba wuyikeheshi; wuyidatoli atama kwonsu kwakwimanawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisweki mulunkuŋu hamu. Yikasi kumesu awu kwaswamana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninami nawa nikwitŋi nami, Komana chikasa cheyeyi aweni chachidiilu chinatweshi kukupulwisha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala behemoti naleŋeli hamu neyi, wadyaŋa matahu neyi ŋombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala mwani Ŋovu jindi jekala munkuma yindi, wuswa windi wekala kunyisunyi yakwivumu dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wemikaŋa mukila windi neyi musida ki-i! Nyijila yakumahandindi yadisela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mafwahindi adi neyi nyiyeŋu yawuneŋu. Nyendu yindi nimakasindi yidi neyi nyishi yayikuŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena diyi wabadikahu hayuma yaNzambi, wamuleŋeli diyi natweshi kumwinyika mpoku yakabali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala kwaamu, mpidi jamusoŋelaŋa yakudya; joji mpidi jahemenaŋa anyama amumpata ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamaŋa mwishina danyitondu yikweti wulelu, mumateti mwavumba, nimumachiŋichiŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyitondu yikweti wulelu yamubutaŋa wulelu wayu wi-i. Nyisombu yakukakaloŋa yamukumaŋa niniku niniku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kela kaloŋa wukwila dibaji yena kuzaala woma nehi. Hela neyi Yodana wukwinzala nikunsaŋilu yindi, yena saŋa adiwunjikilayi kwindi zo-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi wudi nakutona hadi wukumukwata? Hela kumuta mumuhetu kulonda amufululi hamazulu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.40.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
